From 4d4fd6e5c4092c182a07e0c09a8b74fa244e3d7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Google AI Edge <ai-edge-bot@google.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:21:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Populate `lora_param_tensor` when no LoRA adapter is active,
 fixing GPU output corruption (OpenCL and Metal) when running LoRA-capable
 models without an active adapter (`rank=0`).

LiteRT-LM-PiperOrigin-RevId: 1023757177
---
